//! Differential ratchet for `src/engine/battleScriptGivepaydaymoneyOpcode.ts`.
//! Expected complete projected results and controls are generated by executing
//! the canonical TypeScript handler; regenerate with
//! `node --experimental-strip-types
//! core-rs/tools/gen-battle-script-givepaydaymoney-vectors.mjs`.

